---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Welcome to the OwLLM blog"
  description="We're building a local-first AI workstation where you own the hardware, the models, and the agent runtime."
  type="article"
>
  <article class="post">
    <header class="post-header">
      <div class="container">
        <time datetime="2025-07-20" class="post-date">July 20, 2025</time>
        <h1 id="post-title">Welcome to the OwLLM blog</h1>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="post-content container">
      <p>
        We're building a local-first AI workstation where you own the hardware, the models, and the
        agent runtime. OwLLM is designed for people who want the power of modern large language
        models without shipping every prompt to someone else's cloud.
      </p>
      <p>
        This blog is where we'll share release notes, deep-dives into the architecture, and
        behind-the-scenes notes on building a desktop app that can orchestrate multi-agent teams,
        execute sandboxed tools, and split inference across machines.
      </p>
      <p>
        If you want to follow along, grab the latest build from the{" "}
        <a href="/download">download page</a> or join the discussion on{" "}
        <a
          href="https://github.com/OwLLM/owllm/discussions"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
        >
          GitHub
        </a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>

<style>
  .post {
    padding-bottom: 4rem;
  }

  .post-header {
    padding: 4rem 0 2rem;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--bg) 0%, var(--bg-panel) 100%);
    text-align: center;
  }

  .container {
    max-width: 768px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 1rem;
  }

  .post-date {
    display: block;
    color: var(--fg-subtle);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .post-header h1 {
    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 5vw, 2.75rem);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .post-content {
    padding-top: 2rem;
  }

  .post-content p {
    color: var(--fg-muted);
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .post-content a {
    color: var(--accent-ink);
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
</style>
